      {
        "id": 214233,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-31T16:03:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Phantom5613\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/48/1906_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Phantom5613:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yeah, wich is why I'm curious. From what I know they've revealed the foil versions of Stuntman and his promo, along with two cards(the names escape me at the moment) from a Kickstarter Update for OblivAeon.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>As they stipulated in the episode people likely haven’t seen it yet. &nbsp; Typically I’ve had questions regarding stuff I’ve seen as a playtester and this was probably the first I feel they answered. &nbsp;</p>",
