        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-31T18:20:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I like the intro! My thoughts: While we know who Christopher and Adam are, the vast majority of Sentinels fans don’t (other than that their names are on the box). As they get the RPG up and running, they’ll likely get a lot of new listeners who also won’t know, so this is probably a good idea.</p>\n<p>That’s just me, though – definitely understand if other folks don’t like the change. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>",
