        "username": "The_Burning_Stickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-31T20:15:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'd say the new intro needs some cleaning up. Christopher sounded kind of awkward, like he was either reading it for the first time or searching for the words, and it was longer than it needed to be.</p><p>A second, quicker take would be better.</p>",
