        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rjc917/{size}/1888_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-31T21:29:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I read all of the ardent arguments about the new intro on here before actually listening to it, so I went in thinking, \"Wow.&nbsp; How bad is this thing?\".&nbsp; Then when I heard it, my reaction was basically, \"Oh.&nbsp; That was fine.\"&nbsp; I suppose it could have been jarring to people not expecting it, and I guess it could be a little more polished, but yeah, I don't have a particularly positive or negative reaction to it.</p>",
